{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "失陷检测 (V1)",
    "description": "本 API 用于检测内部主机请求的出站地址（域名/IP）是否存在恶意行为，并返回对应的威胁情报标签。",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "paths": {
    "/v1/ioc/query": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "失陷检测",
        "deprecated": false,
        "description": "本 API 用于检测内部主机请求的出站地址（域名/IP）是否存在恶意行为，并返回对应的威胁情报标签。",
        "tags": [],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "apikey",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "您的 API Key。关于如何获取和管理 API Key，请参阅 [API 认证说明](https://ati.threatbook.cn/docs/api-reference/authentication) 页面。\n\n**温馨提示：**\n\n在发起调用前，请确认已将发起请求的服务器 IP 地址绑定至 API Key 白名单，并确认账户具备目标 API 的授权额度。",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "resource",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "待查询的域名、IP 地址或 IP:Port 组合。\n\n支持携带端口查询域名或 IP 地址以获取更精准的情报信息，例如：\n- 待查询域名：\n\n  **googlenew.moy.su**\n\n- 待查询 IPv4 带端口：\n\n  **183.18.2.4:8080**\n  \n- 待查询 IPv6 带端口：\n\n  \\[**2001:0db8:0000:0000:0001:0000:0000:0000**\\]:80",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "msg": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "const": "Success"
                    },
                    "data": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "ips": {
                          "type": "object",
                          "properties": {},
                          "description": "Key 为 IP 地址，Value 为 JSON 对象。每个项包含的完整字段定义如下：\n- **threat_level**: 字符串。威胁等级。\n  - **malicious**: 仅当捕获到与 C2、Sinkhole C2、MiningPool、CoinMiner、Malware 相关的特定活动时，在失陷检测场景下才认定为恶意 (malicious)。\n  - **safe**: 仅从失陷检测视角做出的无威胁判断，并不意味着该 IP 或域名不存在失陷场景之外的其他恶意情报或活动。\n- **confidence_level**: 字符串。置信度等级，分为三个级别：\n  - high (高)\n  - medium (中)\n  - low (低)\n- **judgments**: 数组。情报类型。\n  本接口将 5 种恶意类型定义为**失陷指标 (IOC)**，其他完整情报类型表中的恶意类型将不会在此返回：\n  - C2 (远控服务器)\n  - Sinkhole C2 (接管 C2)\n  - MiningPool (矿池服务)\n  - CoinMiner (暗挖木马)\n  - Malware (恶意软件)\n  \n  此外还会返回中性情报类型，例如 CDN、IDC、DNS 等。\n- **whitelist**: 布尔值。\n  - true: 已加白。\n  - false: 未加白。\n- **APT**: 布尔值。\n  - true: 属于 APT 攻击。\n  - false: 暂无足够证据认定为 APT。\n- **threat_actor**: 数组。关联的攻击团伙/组织。\n- **family**: 数组。关联的病毒或木马家族。\n- **tag_categories**: 数组。每个项的字段如下：\n  - tags_type: 标签类型，例如 \"industry\"（行业）。\n  - tags: 具体标签列表。"
                        },
                        "domains": {
                          "type": "object",
                          "properties": {},
                          "description": "Key 为域名，Value 为 JSON 对象。每个项包含的完整字段定义如下：\n- **categories**: 对象。域名分类。\n  - first_cats: 数组。一级分类。\n  - second_cats: 字符串。二级分类。\n  \n其他字段与上述 \"ips\" 描述相同。"
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "ips",
                        "domains"
                      ]
                    },
                    "response_code": {
                      "type": "integer",
                      "const": 200
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "msg",
                    "data",
                    "response_code"
                  ]
                },
                "example": {
                  "msg": "Success",
                  "data": {
                    "ips": {
                      "183.18.2.4:8080": {
                        "judgments": [
                          "Dynamic IP",
                          "Gateway"
                        ],
                        "whitelist": false,
                        "family": [],
                        "severity": "info",
                        "APT": false,
                        "threat_actor": [],
                        "tag_categories": [],
                        "confidence_level": "high",
                        "threat_level": "safe"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "response_code": 200
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {}
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "msg": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": [
                        "Required:{resource/apikey}",
                        "Invalid parameter:{parameter}"
                      ]
                    },
                    "response_code": {
                      "type": "integer",
                      "const": 400
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "msg",
                    "response_code"
                  ]
                },
                "examples": {
                  "Example 1": {
                    "summary": "示例 1",
                    "value": {
                      "msg": "Required:{resource/apikey}",
                      "response_code": 400
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "msg": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": [
                        "Invalid account status",
                        "Invalid access IP: {actual IP address}",
                        "Invalid API key",
                        "Invalid key status",
                        "No access to the API",
                        "Expired API key",
                        "No access to the requested resource",
                        "No access to: {parameter}"
                      ]
                    },
                    "response_code": {
                      "type": "integer",
                      "const": 401
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "msg",
                    "response_code"
                  ]
                },
                "examples": {
                  "Example 1": {
                    "summary": "示例 1",
                    "value": {
                      "msg": "Invalid account status",
                      "response_code": 401
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "405": {
            "description": "",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "msg": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "const": "Invalid API method"
                    },
                    "response_code": {
                      "type": "integer",
                      "const": 405
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "msg",
                    "response_code"
                  ]
                },
                "examples": {
                  "Example 1": {
                    "summary": "示例 1",
                    "value": {
                      "msg": "Invalid API method",
                      "response_code": 405
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "msg": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": [
                        "Request rate limitation",
                        "Beyond {daily/monthly/total} quotas limitation"
                      ]
                    },
                    "response_code": {
                      "type": "integer",
                      "const": 429
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "msg",
                    "response_code"
                  ]
                },
                "examples": {
                  "Example 1": {
                    "summary": "示例 1",
                    "value": {
                      "msg": "Request rate limitation",
                      "response_code": 429
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "msg": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": [
                        "System error",
                        "URL Download Fail"
                      ]
                    },
                    "response_code": {
                      "type": "integer",
                      "const": 500
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "msg",
                    "response_code"
                  ]
                },
                "examples": {
                  "Example 1": {
                    "summary": "示例 1",
                    "value": {
                      "msg": "System error",
                      "response_code": 500
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": []
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {},
    "securitySchemes": {
      "feeds": {
        "bearerFormat": "JWT",
        "description": "请输入您的 JWT 令牌。您可以调用 /login 接口获取该令牌。",
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer"
      },
      "bearer": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer"
      }
    }
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://openapi.threatbook.cn"
    }
  ]
}
